OL,3,ATories would scrap Burnham's deal with 
OL,4,AEU, deputy leader says                 
OL,6,FConservative deputy leader Alex        
OL,7,FBurghart has said his party would scrap
OL,8,Fthe deal agreed between the UK and the 
OL,9,FEuropean Union on Friday, if the Tories
OL,10,Fwin the next general election.         
OL,12,FThe agreement signed by Prime Minister 
OL,13,FAndy Burnham covers a youth travel     
OL,14,Fscheme, emissions trading and British  
OL,15,Ffood exports.                          
OL,17,FThe government has argued scrapping    
OL,18,Fmost checks on British food exports    
OL,19,Fwill cut costs for businesses and could
OL,20,Fbring down prices for shoppers.        
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
