OL,3,ATories would scrap Burnham's deal with 
OL,4,AEU, deputy leader says                 
OL,6,FBurghart told the BBC's Sunday with    
OL,7,FLaura Kuenssberg programme the deal was
OL,8,F"a dog's dinner", which would not lead 
OL,9,Fto lower prices in the shops and would 
OL,10,Fmean the UK "gives up our ability to   
OL,11,Fset our own rules".                    
